# CODEX.md - Optional Codex-specific notes

Codex should normally use the root `AGENTS.md` file for vault rules.

Use this file only if you want extra Codex-specific guidance.

## Codex-specific preferences

- Work relative to the vault root.
- Show proposed destructive/mass file operations before executing them.
- Prefer small, reviewable file changes.
- Use the rules in `AGENTS.md` as the source of truth.
- End with changed file paths and one next action.

